# Bot1 steals Bot2's Llanowar Elves with Vengeful Possession, then casts Diabolic Edict on itself: the Elves are the creature
# Bot1 controls, so it sacrifices them (CR 701.21a), and a card goes to its owner's graveyard (CR 404.2, 701.21a): Bot2's.

